{"unit_id":"viztor__dsh-tinyfish#card-zh","repo":"viztor/dsh-tinyfish","commit":"37cc1699f3def9259e43377a106aefd1650bd377","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tinyfish 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的网页搜索与抓取插件。它在 DSH 的 web 能力接口注册 TinyFish 搜索和抓取提供方，并默认将两个提供方都设为 tinyfish。主要功能包括按关键词搜索网页、获取网页正文、配置网页类型和时间范围筛选、设置抓取缓存与排除选择器，以及在 TinyFish 直连和 Monid 转发通道间选择。适合需要让 DSH 代理查询实时网页资料并读取页面内容的场景。使用前需配置 TinyFish 或 Monid 凭据，具体取决于所选通道。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:38-49","src/index.ts:575-581","src/index.ts:84-105","src/client.ts:15-22"]}
{"unit_id":"viztor__dsh-tinyfish#card-en","repo":"viztor/dsh-tinyfish","commit":"37cc1699f3def9259e43377a106aefd1650bd377","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tinyfish adds web search and page fetching to DSH Web. It registers TinyFish providers for both web capabilities, selected by default. Users can filter search results and configure page extraction, using either TinyFish directly or Monid as a relay. Configure credentials for the chosen channel.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:38-49","src/index.ts:575-581","src/index.ts:84-105","src/client.ts:15-22"]}
