{"unit_id":"viztor__dsh-tinyfish#feature-1","repo":"viztor/dsh-tinyfish","commit":"37cc1699f3def9259e43377a106aefd1650bd377","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tinyfish 的功能「网页搜索」：通过 DSH web 搜索接口向 TinyFish 查询网页结果。可配置搜索来源类型、语言、地区、域名范围和时间条件，代理提交查询后返回搜索结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/provider.ts:236-243","src/index.ts:122-160"]}
{"unit_id":"viztor__dsh-tinyfish#feature-2","repo":"viztor/dsh-tinyfish","commit":"37cc1699f3def9259e43377a106aefd1650bd377","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tinyfish 的功能「网页抓取」：通过 DSH web 抓取接口获取指定网址的页面内容。每次抓取可沿用配置的缓存时效、单网址超时和 CSS 排除选择器设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/provider.ts:365-373","src/index.ts:164-185"]}
{"unit_id":"viztor__dsh-tinyfish#feature-3","repo":"viztor/dsh-tinyfish","commit":"37cc1699f3def9259e43377a106aefd1650bd377","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tinyfish 的功能「双通道访问」：可选择 direct 调用 TinyFish API，或通过 Monid REST 服务转发搜索和抓取请求；两种通道使用各自配置的凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.ts:13-28","src/index.ts:84-105"]}
